{#-
  Renders the "## Execution graph" section. Inputs:
    graph        — dict[str, list[str]] outer node → deps, insertion order preserved
    waves        — list[list[str]] resolved outer wave order (parallel members per wave)
    subgraphs    — dict[str, SubgraphNode] outer keys that are subgraph nodes
    inner_waves  — dict[str, list[list[str]]] resolved wave order per subgraph
  Emits a mermaid flowchart (one `subgraph … end` cluster per subgraph node, one edge
  line per dep, isolated nodes as bare ids) followed by a numbered wave list
  ("∥"-joined members share a wave; a subgraph's inner waves nest under its entry).
-#}
{%- set depended = [] -%}
{%- for step, deps in graph.items() -%}
{%- for dep in deps -%}
{%- if dep not in depended -%}{{ depended.append(dep) or "" }}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
## Execution graph

```mermaid
flowchart TD
{% for sg_name, sg in subgraphs.items() %}{% set inner_depended = [] %}{% for istep, ideps in sg.graph.items() %}{% for idep in ideps %}{% if idep not in inner_depended %}{{ inner_depended.append(idep) or "" }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}  subgraph {{ sg_name }}["{{ sg_name }}{% if sg.repeat %} (repeat){% endif %}"]
{% for istep, ideps in sg.graph.items() %}{% for idep in ideps %}    {{ idep }} --> {{ istep }}
{% endfor %}{% endfor %}{% for istep, ideps in sg.graph.items() %}{% if not ideps and istep not in inner_depended %}    {{ istep }}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}  end
{% endfor %}{% for step, deps in graph.items() %}{% for dep in deps %}  {{ dep }} --> {{ step }}
{% endfor %}{% endfor %}{% for step, deps in graph.items() %}{% if not deps and step not in depended and step not in subgraphs %}  {{ step }}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}```

Steps on one line run in parallel — spawn all their sub-agents in one message,
wait for all to finish, then start the next wave.

